The Python files implement selected Java algorithm and temporal-data classes.
GUI, rendering, research experiment scripts and metrics are outside this port.
The Python port changes AutoTau estimation and adds ARCOL aspect-ratio forces
and optional Numba repulsion acceleration. See README.md for usage and behavior.
